<title>CHINA: China Jan-Nov sugar exports soar 112.9 pct.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Nov sugar exports soar 112.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's sugar exports reached 616,539 tonnes in the first 11 months of 1996, up 112.9 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p>China exported 25,515 tonnes of sugar in November alone.</p>
<p>China's sugar imports slumped by 55.6 percent to 1.16 million tonnes in the first 11 months compared with the year-ago period, the figures showed.</p>
<p>China imported 5,000 tonnes of sugar in November alone.</p>
</text>
